    "html": "<div class=\"gc\"><section class=\"gc-sec gc-soft\" id=\"negozio\"><div class=\"gc-wrap\"><p class=\"gc-eyebrow\">Shop</p><h2 class=\"gc-h2\">Everything for your pet</h2><p class=\"gc-lead\">Pick a category and find what you need.</p><div class=\"gc-plat\"><div class=\"gc-pl\"><a href=\"__BASEURL__/en/shop/category/dogs/\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1543466835-00a7907e9de1?w=1200&q=80\" alt=\"Dogs\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover;border-radius:12px;display:block;margin:0 0 .9rem\"></a><b>Dogs</b><p>Everything you need for the daily care and play of your dog, for every size.</p><a class=\"gc-link\" href=\"__BASEURL__/en/shop/category/dogs/\">See products</a></div><div class=\"gc-pl\"><a href=\"__BASEURL__/en/shop/category/cats/\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1514888286974-6c03e2ca1dba?w=1200&q=80\" alt=\"Cats\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover;border-radius:12px;display:block;margin:0 0 .9rem\"></a><b>Cats</b><p>Products for the wellbeing and fun of your cat, indoors.</p><a class=\"gc-link\" href=\"__BASEURL__/en/shop/category/cats/\">See products</a></div><div class=\"gc-pl\"><a href=\"__BASEURL__/en/shop/category/birds/\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1452570053594-1b985d6ea890?w=1200&q=80\" alt=\"Birds\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover;border-radius:12px;display:block;margin:0 0 .9rem\"></a><b>Birds</b><p>Accessories designed for the daily care of companion birds.</p><a class=\"gc-link\" href=\"__BASEURL__/en/shop/category/birds/\">See products</a></div><div class=\"gc-pl\"><a href=\"__BASEURL__/en/shop/category/reptiles/\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1601987177651-8edfe6c20009?w=1200&q=80\" alt=\"Reptiles\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover;border-radius:12px;display:block;margin:0 0 .9rem\"></a><b>Reptiles</b><p>Everything you need to recreate the ideal habitat for your reptile.</p><a class=\"gc-link\" href=\"__BASEURL__/en/shop/category/reptiles/\">See products</a></div><div class=\"gc-pl\"><a href=\"__BASEURL__/en/shop/category/small-mammals/\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1591561582301-7ce6588cc286?w=1200&q=80\" alt=\"Small Mammals\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover;border-radius:12px;display:block;margin:0 0 .9rem\"></a><b>Small Mammals</b><p>Accessories dedicated to rabbits, hamsters, guinea pigs and other small home companions.</p><a class=\"gc-link\" href=\"__BASEURL__/en/shop/category/small-mammals/\">See products</a></div><div class=\"gc-pl\"><a href=\"__BASEURL__/en/shop/category/fish/\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1524704796725-9fc3044a58b2?w=1200&q=80\" alt=\"Fish\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover;border-radius:12px;display:block;margin:0 0 .9rem\"></a><b>Fish</b><p>Everything to set up and maintain a healthy, well-kept freshwater aquarium.</p><a class=\"gc-link\" href=\"__BASEURL__/en/shop/category/fish/\">See products</a></div><div class=\"gc-pl\"><a href=\"__BASEURL__/en/shop/category/horses/\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1553284965-83fd3e82fa5a?w=1200&q=80\" alt=\"Horses\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover;border-radius:12px;display:block;margin:0 0 .9rem\"></a><b>Horses</b><p>Accessories and care products designed for the horse and stable life.</p><a class=\"gc-link\" href=\"__BASEURL__/en/shop/category/horses/\">See products</a></div></div></div></section></div>"
