    "html": "<div class=\"gc\"><section class=\"gc-sec\" id=\"guide\"><div class=\"gc-wrap\"><p class=\"gc-eyebrow\">Encyclopedias</p><h2 class=\"gc-h2\">Breed and species guides</h2><p class=\"gc-lead\">Traits, temperament and needs of every animal, explained simply.</p><div class=\"gc-plat\"><div class=\"gc-pl\"><a href=\"__BASEURL__/en/blog/dog-encyclopedia/\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1543466835-00a7907e9de1?w=1200&q=80\" alt=\"Dog Encyclopedia\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover;border-radius:12px;display:block;margin:0 0 .9rem\"></a><b>Dog Encyclopedia</b><p>All dog breeds explained: characteristics, size, temperament and needs of every breed, from companion dogs to working dogs.</p></div><div class=\"gc-pl\"><a href=\"__BASEURL__/en/blog/cat-encyclopedia/\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1514888286974-6c03e2ca1dba?w=1200&q=80\" alt=\"Cat Encyclopedia\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover;border-radius:12px;display:block;margin:0 0 .9rem\"></a><b>Cat Encyclopedia</b><p>All cat breeds explained: appearance, temperament and care of every breed, from short-haired to long-haired cats.</p></div><div class=\"gc-pl\"><a href=\"__BASEURL__/en/blog/bird-encyclopedia/\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1452570053594-1b985d6ea890?w=1200&q=80\" alt=\"Bird Encyclopedia\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover;border-radius:12px;display:block;margin:0 0 .9rem\"></a><b>Bird Encyclopedia</b><p>The most common companion bird species: characteristics, behavior and care of every species, from canaries to parrots.</p></div><div class=\"gc-pl\"><a href=\"__BASEURL__/en/blog/reptile-encyclopedia/\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1601987177651-8edfe6c20009?w=1200&q=80\" alt=\"Reptile Encyclopedia\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover;border-radius:12px;display:block;margin:0 0 .9rem\"></a><b>Reptile Encyclopedia</b><p>Reptile and amphibian species kept at home: characteristics, ideal habitat and needs of every species, from turtles to geckos and snakes.</p></div><div class=\"gc-pl\"><a href=\"__BASEURL__/en/blog/small-mammal-encyclopedia/\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1591561582301-7ce6588cc286?w=1200&q=80\" alt=\"Small Mammal Encyclopedia\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover;border-radius:12px;display:block;margin:0 0 .9rem\"></a><b>Small Mammal Encyclopedia</b><p>All breeds and species of companion small mammals: rabbits, hamsters, guinea pigs and more, with characteristics and care for each.</p></div><div class=\"gc-pl\"><a href=\"__BASEURL__/en/blog/fish-encyclopedia/\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1524704796725-9fc3044a58b2?w=1200&q=80\" alt=\"Fish Encyclopedia\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover;border-radius:12px;display:block;margin:0 0 .9rem\"></a><b>Fish Encyclopedia</b><p>The most common aquarium fish species: characteristics, behavior and compatibility of every species, for freshwater aquariums.</p></div><div class=\"gc-pl\"><a href=\"__BASEURL__/en/blog/horse-encyclopedia/\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1553284965-83fd3e82fa5a?w=1200&q=80\" alt=\"Horse Encyclopedia\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover;border-radius:12px;display:block;margin:0 0 .9rem\"></a><b>Horse Encyclopedia</b><p>All horse breeds explained: origin, physical characteristics and temperament of every breed, from riding horses to draft horses.</p></div></div><p style=\"margin-top:1.6rem\"><a class=\"gc-btn gc-btn-k\" href=\"__BASEURL__/en/blog/\">Go to the blog</a></p></div></section></div>"
